msgstr "작업"

#. module: eh_account_close_workflow
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_close_workflow.field_eh_close_run__task_done_count
msgid ""
"Tasks in done or not_applicable state. Both count as completed for progress "
"reporting."
msgstr "done 또는 not_applicable 상태의 작업입니다. 진행 상황 보고에서 두 상태 모두 완료로 집계됩니다."

#. module: eh_account_close_workflow
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_close_workflow.field_eh_close_run__task_ids
msgid "Tasks instantiated from the checklist template for this run."
msgstr "이 실행의 체크리스트 템플릿에서 인스턴스화된 작업입니다."

#. module: eh_account_close_workflow
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_close_workflow.field_eh_close_run__task_blocked_count
msgid ""
"Tasks marked blocked. Approval is gated until every blocked task is resolved"
" or marked not_applicable."
msgstr ""
"blocked로 표시된 작업입니다. 차단된 모든 작업이 해결되거나 not_applicable로 표시될 때까지 승인이 보류됩니다."

#. module: eh_account_close_workflow
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_close_workflow.field_eh_close_run__task_pending_count
msgid ""
"Tasks still in pending or in_progress. Required pending tasks block the "
"request-approval transition."
msgstr "여전히 pending 또는 in_progress 상태인 작업입니다. 필수 대기 작업은 승인 요청 전환을 차단합니다."

#. module: eh_account_close_workflow
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_close_workflow.field_eh_close_run__approved_at
msgid "Timestamp at which approved_by_id closed the run."
msgstr "approved_by_id 가 실행을 종료한 타임스탬프입니다."

#. module: eh_account_close_workflow
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_close_workflow.field_eh_close_run__prepared_at
msgid "Timestamp at which prepared_by_id moved the run to in_progress."
msgstr "prepared_by_id 가 실행을 in_progress 로 이동한 타임스탬프입니다."

#. module: eh_account_close_workflow
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_close_workflow.field_eh_close_run__reopened_at
msgid "Timestamp at which reopened_by_id reopened the closed run."
msgstr "reopened_by_id 가 종료된 실행을 다시 연 타임스탬프입니다."

#. module: eh_account_close_workflow
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_close_workflow.field_eh_close_run__reviewed_at
msgid "Timestamp at which reviewed_by_id requested approval."
msgstr "reviewed_by_id 가 승인을 요청한 타임스탬프입니다."

#. module: eh_account_close_workflow
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_close_workflow.field_eh_close_task__completed_at
msgid "Timestamp at which the task was marked complete."
msgstr "작업이 완료로 표시된 타임스탬프입니다."

#. module: eh_account_close_workflow
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_close_workflow.field_eh_close_run__task_count
msgid "Total number of tasks instantiated on this run."
msgstr "이번 실행에서 생성된 작업의 총 수입니다."

